WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:10.042
Addition puts groups together; subtraction takes some away.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:21.684
Multiplication is a quick way to add equal groups. For example, twelve times fourteen

00:00:21.684 --> 00:00:29.246
is twelve times ten, plus twelve times four: one hundred twenty plus forty-eight

00:00:29.246 --> 00:00:32.082
makes one hundred sixty-eight.

00:00:34.882 --> 00:00:41.552
In a mixed calculation, do multiplication and division before addition and

00:00:41.552 --> 00:00:42.634
subtraction.
